# The Resort Area, the east end of the Battle Frontier's island. Post-game,
# so the story-cleared and national-dex flags are part of the recipe.
#
# The Fight Area was the first choice and is a written refusal instead: its
# map change starts and never settles, and pressing A at it walks the player
# somewhere else rather than finishing whatever is waiting. The Survival Area
# on the same island mints clean, so it is that map and not the island.
#
# Coordinates are the fly destination the game's own spawn table
# carries for this town, so nothing here is a guessed tile.

name RESORT
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 11370
money 60000
badge BADGE_ID_COAL
badge BADGE_ID_FOREST
badge BADGE_ID_COBBLE
badge BADGE_ID_FEN
badge BADGE_ID_RELIC
badge BADGE_ID_MINE
badge BADGE_ID_ICICLE
badge BADGE_ID_BEACON
story-cleared 1
national-dex 1
party SPECIES_INFERNAPE 60 ITEM_NONE
party SPECIES_GARCHOMP 60 ITEM_NONE
map MAP_HEADER_RESORT_AREA 0x322 0x1D9 FACE_DOWN
